{"id":"kimono-girls","title":"Polished Crystal Kimono Girls: Ecruteak Locations, Teams & Rewards","description":"Find every Kimono Girl in Pokémon Polished Crystal: Dance Theatre locations, Eeveelution teams, Surf progression, traveling cousins, and reward items.","category":"pokemon-collecting","hero":null,"html":"<h2 id=\"introduction\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#introduction\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Introduction</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">There are eight Kimono Girls in <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Pokémon Polished Crystal</strong>. Start with five Eeveelution trainers at the Ecruteak City Dance Theatre for the required Surf reward, then find three traveling cousins for optional items. This guide is for Polished Crystal; other Pokémon games use different Kimono Girl events and teams.</p>\n<h2 id=\"quick-order\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#quick-order\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Quick order</h2>\n<ol class=\"list-decimal ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Beat the five Dance Theatre trainers in Ecruteak City.</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Speak to the gentleman in the audience for <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">HM03 Surf</strong>.</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Find Mako, Ami, and Mina after the Dance Theatre battles for their bonus rewards.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"dance-theatre-ecruteak-city\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#dance-theatre-ecruteak-city\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Dance Theatre (Ecruteak City)</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">The main five are inside the <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/locations/dancetheatre\">Dance Theatre</a>. They&#x27;re all level 20 and hold Lum Berries, so don&#x27;t bother trying to status them right away.</p>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto mv-exclude-content mt-6\" data-no-optimize=\"1\"><div data-slot=\"table-container\" class=\"relative w-full overflow-x-auto\"><table data-slot=\"table\" class=\"caption-bottom text-sm w-max min-w-full\"><thead data-slot=\"table-header\" class=\"[&amp;_tr]:border-b bg-muted\"><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">Name</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">Pokémon</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">Position</th></tr></thead><tbody data-slot=\"table-body\" class=\"[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0\"><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">Naoko</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/pokemon/flareon\">Flareon</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox]