pace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/pokemon/vaporeon\">Vaporeon</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">Right side of stage</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">Miki</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/pokemon/jolteon\">Jolteon</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">Right side of stage</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Once you beat all five, talk to the gentleman sitting in the audience. He&#x27;s the one who actually gives you <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">HM03 Surf</strong>.</p>\n<!--$--><div class=\"relative w-full\" style=\"min-height:250px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"flex h-full min-h-full w-full\" style=\"min-height:250px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center\"></div></div></div><!--/$-->\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"traveling-kimono-girls\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#traveling-kimono-girls\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Traveling Kimono Girls</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Three cousins are out training in different parts of Johto. They won&#x27;t 战斗 you until you&#x27;ve beaten all five sisters at the Dance Theatre first. Their 宝可梦 scale with your 徽章 count, so they stay relevant even if you find them later.</p>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto mv-exclude-content mt-6\" data-no-optimize=\"1\"><div data-slot=\"table-container\" class=\"relative w-full overflow-x-auto\"><table data-slot=\"table\" class=\"caption-bottom text-sm w-max min-w-full\"><thead data-slot=\"table-header\" class=\"[&amp;_tr]:border-b bg-muted\"><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">Name</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">宝可梦</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">地点</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody data-slot=\"table-body\" class=\"[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0\"><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">Mako</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/pokemon/leafeon\">Leafeon</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/locations/sprouttower1f\">Sprout 塔 1F</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">Rare Candy</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">Ami</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/pokemon/glaceon\">Glaceon</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/locations/snowtopmountaininside\">Snowtop Mountain (Inside)</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">PP Max</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">Mina</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/pokemon/sylveon\">Sylveon</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/locations/dragonsdenb1f\">Dragon&#x27;s Den B1F</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">特性 Patch</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Mina&#x27;s 特性 Patch is probably the best 奖励 of the bunch. If you want to swap a 宝可梦 to its Hidden 特性 without 繁殖, that&#x27;s how you do it.</p>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"battle-order\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#battle-order\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>战斗 Order</h2>\n<ol class=\"list-decimal ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Beat all five girls at the Dance Theatre</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Get Surf from the gentleman</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Hunt down Mako, Ami, and Mina whenever you want their 物品</li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Personally, I usually grab Mako&#x27;s Rare Candy early since Sprout 塔 is right there in Violet 市. The other two are more out of the way.</p>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"battle-tips\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#battle-tips\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>战斗 提示</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">They all use Eeveelutions with Lum Berries. So status 技能 won&#x27;t stick on the first try.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">If you&#x27;re having trouble, a Ground-属性 handles both Flareon and Jolteon. Fighting-属性 beats Umbreon. Honestly at 等级 20 they&#x27;re not that tough if you have a decent 队伍, but the 属性 variety can 捕获 you off guard if you&#x27;re not prepared.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">The traveling girls scale with badges so they hit harder. Mina&#x27;s Sylveon in particular can be annoying if you don&#x27;t have a Steel or Poison 属性 ready.</p>\n"}